{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51249","headline":"赠任华 · 高适","name":"赠任华","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丈夫结交须结贫，贫者结交交始亲。\n世人不解结交者，唯重黄金不重人。\n黄金虽多有尽时，结交一成无竭期。\n君不见管仲与鲍叔，至今留名名不移。\n（《唐诗纪事》二二《任华》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51249.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51249","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}